  "is_special_feature": true,
  "review": "<h2 id=\"intro\">【2026シルバーウィーク】一人旅におすすめの温泉宿6選｜5連休でリフレッシュ！ソロ旅歓迎の名湯・絶景宿</h2>\n<p>「連休は一人で気ままに旅がしたい」「日常を離れて温泉でリフレッシュしたい」——そんなソロ旅派にとって、5連休のシルバーウィークは絶好のチャンスです。</p>\n<p>一人旅の場合、<strong>「1名プランがある」「一人でも気まずくない」「自由な時間を過ごせる」</strong>宿選びが最重要。楽天トラベルで見つけた<strong>ソロ旅歓迎の温泉旅館・ホテル</strong>を集めました。</p>\n<div class=\"my-6 p-5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl shadow-sm\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-gray-200 pb-2 mb-3\">📌 目次</h3>\n  <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-700 font-medium\">\n    <li><a href=\"#merit\" class=\"hover:underline\">1. 🧳 シルバーウィーク一人旅の5つの魅力</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"#ranking\" class=\"hover:underline\">2. 🏨 一人旅におすすめの宿6選</a></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-gray-200\" />\n<h2 id=\"merit\">🧳 1. シルバーウィーク一人旅の5つの魅力</h2>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-6\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-violet-50 border border-violet-200\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-violet-950 text-sm\">① スケジュールは完全に自分次第</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-violet-900/80 mt-1\">朝寝坊もOK、温泉に3回入るもOK。誰にも合わせる必要がない自由な旅。</p></div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-indigo-950 text-sm\">② 秋の温泉地は一人旅に最高の季節</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-indigo-900/80 mt-1\">涼しい風・色づく木々・静かな露天風呂。秋は一人で没頭するのにぴったり。</p></div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-blue-950 text-sm\">③ 5連休なら「連泊」でゆったり湯治</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-blue-900/80 mt-1\">普段の土日では難しい2〜3泊の連泊で、本格的な湯治体験が叶います。</p></div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-teal-950 text-sm\">④ 自分へのご褒美に「ちょっと贅沢」を</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-teal-900/80 mt-1\">普段は手が出ない高級旅館も、一人なら予算内に収まることが多い。</p></div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-amber-950 text-sm\">⑤ 新しい自分に出会える</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-amber-900/80 mt-1\">旅先での偶然の出会いや発見が、日常に戻ったときの活力になります。</p></div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-gray-200\" />\n<h2 id=\"ranking\">🏨 おすすめ宿・ホテル一覧</h2>\n<p>楽天トラベルで人気の実在施設をまとめています。全国の名湯・名宿の中から、テーマに合った高評価の宿を選んでみました。</p>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-500/10 via-indigo-500/10 to-blue-500/10 border border-violet-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-violet-900 bg-violet-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">🍁 おすすめ 第1位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-violet-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">鳥取県</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-violet-800\">⭐ 4.45 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/40046/40046.jpg\" alt=\"三朝温泉　旅館　大橋\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-violet-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-violet-950\">三朝温泉　旅館　大橋</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-violet-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">舘は国登録有形文化財。自家源泉５ヶ所の内、自噴泉が３ヶ所ある「巌窟の湯」が名物風呂！</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F40046%2F40046.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-violet-500 hover:to-indigo-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      🍁 一人旅プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-500/10 via-indigo-500/10 to-blue-500/10 border border-violet-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-violet-900 bg-violet-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">🍁 おすすめ 第2位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-violet-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">島根県</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-violet-800\">⭐ 3.47 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/108736/108736.jpg\" alt=\"湯迫温泉旅館\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-violet-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-violet-950\">湯迫温泉旅館</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-violet-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">◆ペット可◆日本海の「海の幸」と島根の「山の幸」が堪能できるお料理が自慢！石見銀山までお車15分！</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F108736%2F108736.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-violet-500 hover:to-indigo-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      🍁 一人旅プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-500/10 via-indigo-500/10 to-blue-500/10 border border-violet-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-violet-900 bg-violet-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">🍁 おすすめ 第3位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-violet-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">山梨県</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-violet-800\">⭐ 4.41 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/196489/196489.jpg\" alt=\"信玄の湯　湯村温泉　旅館明治　太宰治ゆかりの宿\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-violet-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-violet-950\">信玄の湯　湯村温泉　旅館明治　太宰治ゆかりの宿</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-violet-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">2025年8月1日新規オープン！信玄の湯とこだわりの朝ごはんで心ほぐれるひと時を。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F196489%2F196489.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-violet-500 hover:to-indigo-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      🍁 一人旅プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-500/10 via-indigo-500/10 to-blue-500/10 border border-violet-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-violet-900 bg-violet-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">🍁 おすすめ 第4位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-violet-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">奈良県</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-violet-800\">⭐ 4.1 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/68262/68262.jpg\" alt=\"洞川温泉　桝源旅館\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-violet-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-violet-950\">洞川温泉　桝源旅館</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-violet-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">林間学校等でも使われる当館は、古きよき日本の情緒と、最高の自然を今に伝えます。珍しい漢方の温泉。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F68262%2F68262.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-violet-500 hover:to-indigo-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      🍁 一人旅プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-500/10 via-indigo-500/10 to-blue-500/10 border border-violet-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-violet-900 bg-violet-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">🍁 おすすめ 第5位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-violet-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">山口県</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-violet-800\">⭐ 4.26 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/147160/147160.jpg\" alt=\"萩温泉郷　海が奏でる癒しの宿　リゾートホテル美萩\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-violet-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-violet-950\">萩温泉郷　海が奏でる癒しの宿　リゾートホテル美萩</h3>\n      <p class=\"tex